\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Study area map encompassing Greater Jakarta (\textit  {Jabodetabek}) and the Karawang industrial corridor ($\sim $12,800~km$^2$), overlaid on an Esri WorldStreetMap basemap. Administrative boundaries delineate DKI Jakarta and constituent municipalities/regencies across Banten (Kota Tangerang, Kota Tangerang Selatan, Kabupaten Tangerang) and West Java (Kota Depok, Kota Bogor, Kabupaten Bogor, Kota Bekasi, Kabupaten Bekasi, Kabupaten Karawang). Major transportation hubs (CGK Airport, Tanjung Priok Port), urban commercial cores (Monas CBD, BSD City, Cikarang), and southern volcanic landmarks (Mount Salak, Mount Gede) are indicated. Inset (top-right) highlights regional placement within Java Island, Indonesia.}}{6}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:study_area_map}{{2}{6}{Study area map encompassing Greater Jakarta (\textit {Jabodetabek}) and the Karawang industrial corridor ($\sim $12,800~km$^2$), overlaid on an Esri WorldStreetMap basemap. Administrative boundaries delineate DKI Jakarta and constituent municipalities/regencies across Banten (Kota Tangerang, Kota Tangerang Selatan, Kabupaten Tangerang) and West Java (Kota Depok, Kota Bogor, Kabupaten Bogor, Kota Bekasi, Kabupaten Bekasi, Kabupaten Karawang). Major transportation hubs (CGK Airport, Tanjung Priok Port), urban commercial cores (Monas CBD, BSD City, Cikarang), and southern volcanic landmarks (Mount Salak, Mount Gede) are indicated. Inset (top-right) highlights regional placement within Java Island, Indonesia}{figure.caption.2}{}}
